WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.493
Your checklist for today.

2
00:00:01.773 --> 00:00:17.795
By the end of today you should have, committed to your project repository: a plan file with the decision question, the systems, the margin, the scoring rules, and the cost assumptions; the base model choice with its license obligations recorded; a frozen,

3
00:00:18.075 --> 00:00:26.693
fingerprinted test set of at least 100 cases from held-out meetings, plus a dev split; and a budget for compute and API spending.

4
00:00:26.973 --> 00:00:28.552
Nothing has been trained yet.

5
00:00:28.832 --> 00:00:36.235
That is the point: from tomorrow on, every number you produce lands in a structure you decided on before you knew what it would say.
